      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED SCENTSATION (3) is the one to beat after a dominant maiden win at this track and a solid third at Townsville, where he was beaten just under two lengths. He has won at this distance range, handled soft ground with a placing, and the return to this venue is a clear positive. MISSILE BABY (7) has the profile to improve second-up after working home evenly for third at Bowen, and her record at the track and trip and with Sean Cormack all reads well. WASABI BARBIE (5) resumes with a sound trial behind her and brings a useful track-and-trip profile, although she was beaten as favourite before the spell and has to produce it fresh. STYLISH DIAMOND (4) is very consistent, ended last campaign placed in a 2yo Open at Townsville, and her overall placing record keeps her firmly in the minor-money mix.",
